# Treat binaries, media, and compiled artifacts as binary to prevent diff thrashing and memory spikes
*.mp4 binary
*.m4a binary
*.mov binary
*.avi binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.rlib binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.o binary
*.pyc binary
*.pyo binary
